sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 用户
    participant Worktree as 工作区
    participant Index as 索引
    participant Objects as 对象库
    participant Ref as 活动引用

    User->>Worktree: 编辑文件
    User->>Index: minigit add
    Index->>Objects: 写入 Blob
    Index->>Index: 写入索引条目
    User->>Objects: minigit commit
    Objects->>Objects: 从索引生成 Tree
    Objects->>Objects: 创建 Commit
    Objects->>Ref: 更新 refs/heads/master
